# D3-FE-007: An oxygen pulse can restart a limited acetification step
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL @ 30C
add v1 ethanol 0.001mol
add v1 acetobacter 1g
seal v1 20mL
add v1 O2 0.0001mol
wait 48h
inspect
add v1 O2 0.0005mol
wait 48h
measure v1 ph
chromatograph v1
inspect
